# WellFinanced — Financial Advisor PWA

A mobile-first Progressive Web App built with **Next.js App Router + Bun**, integrating with the existing FastAPI backend with swagger .json endpoint at `https://kamarshalaby0--wellfinanced-fastapi-app.modal.run/api/v1/openapi.json`.

## Key Decisions & Constraints

| Decision | Choice |
|---|---|
| Runtime | Bun |
| Framework | Next.js 15 (App Router) |
| PWA | Serwist (`@serwist/next`) — modern Workbox successor built for Next.js |
| Charts | Chart.js + `react-chartjs-2` |
| AI Chat | `@ai-sdk/react` `useChat()` → Next.js proxy route → backend `/api/chat` |
| API Codegen | `openapi-sync` — generates TS types, SWR hooks, and endpoint constants from the live OpenAPI spec |
| Styling | Vanilla CSS with CSS custom properties (design tokens) |
| Typography | Google Fonts — Inter (body) + DM Sans (headings) |
| Auth | **Skipped for now** — single-user demo mode |
| Currency | EGP only, with an extensible formatting utility |
| Navigation | Bottom navbar (5 items) — mobile-first |

