#### [NEW] [globals.css](file:///d:/Downloads/selected-project/app/globals.css)

Design system with CSS custom properties:

- **Color palette**: Dark theme with emerald/teal accent (financial trust aesthetic)
  - `--bg-primary: hsl(220, 20%, 8%)` — deep dark background
  - `--bg-card: hsl(220, 18%, 12%)` — card surfaces
  - `--bg-elevated: hsl(220, 16%, 16%)` — elevated surfaces
  - `--accent: hsl(160, 70%, 45%)` — emerald green (money/growth)
  - `--accent-glow: hsl(160, 70%, 45%, 0.15)` — accent glow for effects
  - `--danger: hsl(0, 72%, 56%)` — outflows/errors
  - `--warning: hsl(38, 92%, 55%)` — pending states
  - `--text-primary`, `--text-secondary`, `--text-muted`
- **Spacing scale**: 4px base (`--space-1` through `--space-12`)
- **Border radius**: `--radius-sm`, `--radius-md`, `--radius-lg`, `--radius-full`
- **Shadows**: Layered shadows for depth
- **Transitions**: `--transition-fast`, `--transition-normal`
- **Safe areas**: `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)` for bottom nav on notched devices
- **Typography**: Font size scale using clamp() for fluid responsive sizing

