#### [KEPT] Base client customisation in [useApi.ts](file:///d:/Downloads/selected-project/lib/hooks/useApi.ts)

The generated `clients.ts` handles low-level fetch and envelope unwrapping automatically. `useApi.ts` becomes a **thin shim** that:
- Re-exports the generated SWR hooks for convenience (`export * from '../generated/wellfinanced/hooks'`)
- Adds any app-specific helpers (e.g. pagination cursor management, optimistic updates)
- Injects the auth header once authentication is added (single place to update)

