### Phase 3: Entity Pages (Iterative)

> Each page will be designed individually per user's specifications. Initial scaffold includes placeholder pages with consistent layout + empty states.

- `/accounts` — Account management
- `/money` — Combined inflows/outflows feed
- `/counterparties` — Counterparty management  
- `/flows` — Financial flow management
- `/installments` — Installment tracking
- `/schedules` — Schedule management
- `/assets` — Asset portfolio

Each entity page will follow a consistent pattern:
- List view with cards
- Detail view via `[id]` route
- Create/edit via bottom sheet modals
- Delete with confirmation
- Skeleton loading states

